<title>SRI LANKA: Dockyard up 4.11 pct on retail buying.</title>
<headline>Dockyard up 4.11 pct on retail buying.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Colombo Dockyard Ltd rose 4.11 percent, or 75 cents, to 19 rupees in early Monday trade, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;With the government concentrating on developing infrastructure, especially in the port, Dockyard profits are also seen rising in coming years,&quot; said a broker who declined to be identified.</p>
<p>The company builds and repairs ships in the port.</p>
<p>The government has said it is developing Colombo into hub port for south Asia.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
